$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step B. A mixture of
3-(7-bromo-4-methyl-3-oxo-2,3,4,10-tetrahydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-6-ylamino)-azetidine-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (1.5 g, 3.22 mmol),
4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-2-(prop-1-en-2-yl)-1,3,2-dioxaborolane (1.62 g, 9.66
mmol), K2CO3 (1.33 g, 9.66 mmol) and
[1,1’-bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocene]palladium(II) chloride (0.544 g,
0.64 mmol) in a mixture of 10% water in dioxane (35 mL) was heated at 80
oC for 2 h. The reaction mixture was cooled to ambient temperature and
concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by column chromatography
on silica gel (eluting with 20% EtOAc in petroleum ether).
3-(7-isopropenyl-4-methyl-3-oxo-2,3,4,10-tetrahydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-6-ylamino)-azetidine-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (1.15 g, 84%) as a pale solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 8.19 (br s, 1H), 6.73 (s, 1H), 5.85 (s, 1H), 5.32 (s, 1H), 5.04
(s, 1H), 4.64 (m, 1H), 4.51 (m, 2H), 4.28 (m, 3H), 4.11 (m, 1H), 3.69 (m,
2H), 2.01 (s, 3H), 1.48 (d, J = 6.4 Hz, 3H), 1.22 (s, 9H). LC/MS (Table
1, Method 2) Rt = 1.202 min.; MS m/z: 428 [M+H]+.
