$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of tetraethyl
4,4',4'',4'''-((pyrene-1,3,6,8-tetrayltetrakis(benzene-4,1-
diyl))tetrakis(ethyne-2,1-diyl))tetrabenzoate (13): Compound 12 (1.59 g,
4.23 mmol), 1,3,6,8-tetrabromopyrene (497 mg, 0.960 mmol), PdCl2(dppf)
(160 mg, CsF (2.75 g, 18.1 mmol) were added into a 150mL double neck
round bottom flask with stir bar. The assembly is evacuated for 15
minutes while a mixture of dioxane (100 mL) and water (50 mL) is being
degassed. The evacuated reaction flask was filled with N2 and degassed
dioxane/ water solution was transferred into the reaction flask. The
reaction was then heated at 80°C for 20 hours. The reaction was cooled
down and filtered. The solid part was reprecipitated with chloroform and
methanol, and reprecipitated again with chloroform and hexanes. Filtrate
was combined and evaporated, dissolved in small amount of CH2Cl2 and
column chromatography is used to purify it. The gradient of the eluent
went from pure CH2Cl2 to 10% EtOAc in CH2Cl2. Two parts of the product
was combined as a yellow soild (800 mg, 70%). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ
1.42 (t, J = 7.1 Hz, 12H), 4.40 (q, J = 7.1 Hz, 8H), 7.65 (d, J = 8.4 Hz,
8H), 7.70 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 8H), 7.75 (d, J = 8.2 Hz, 8H), 8.03 (s, 2H),
8.06 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 8H), 8.21 (s, 4H). 13C NMR (126 MHz, CDCl3) δ 14.50,
61.34, 89.68, 92.25, 122.07, 125.62, 126.08, 127.93, 128.36, 129.45,
129.68, 130.05, 130.90, 131.67, 131.97, 136.87, 141.40, 166.23. MALDI-ToF
MS: m/z 1194.32 (1194.41 calcd. for M+).
